      "releaseNotes": "“The one where I make getting started easier”\n\nBe sure to check the release notes for prior versions to see what's new! I update the app regularly in response to feedback like yours. Read them at https://greylineft8.com/changelog.html\n\nShoutouts:\nVK2AWN - Validating IC-7300 functionality, providing Field Notes and photo, suggesting CQ only filter\nKR3BST - Providing Field Notes and photo\nK4RZO the coyote - Providing Field Notes and photo\n\nFeatures:\n- Added a brand new first-time onboarding experience. This will help new users get set up and on the air quickly. If you're already set up but still want to check out the onboarding flow, there’s a button in Settings to start it manually.\n- Added a new filter to the Band Activity view that only shows CQ calls and exchanges that you’re actively participating in or that mention your callsign specifically. This can optionally be set to apply on startup\n- Links to the Field Notes site as well as support email are now in Settings\n\nFixes:\n- Better handling of microphone and location permissions\n- Bundled latest version of Big CTY data\n\nGive it a try and please leave a review if you enjoy using Greyline! I hope it makes your activations just a tiny bit more joyful. Thanks for bringing me along and 73!",
